| 11 | 11 | 3x²−y², x>y | 1 | yes | yes |
| 13 | 1 | 4x²+y² | 1 | yes | yes |
| 17 | 5 | 4x²+y² | 1 | yes | yes |
| 19 | 7 | 3x²+y² | 1 | yes | yes |
| 23 | 11 | 3x²−y², x>y | 1 | yes | yes |
| 25 | 1 | 4x²+y² | 1 | no | no |
| 29 | 5 | 4x²+y² | 1 | yes | yes |
| 31 | 7 | 3x²+y² | 1 | yes | yes |
| 35 | 11 | 3x²−y², x>y | 0 | yes | no |
| 37 | 1 | 4x²+y² | 1 | yes | yes |
